**Security decisions implemented:**
- Identity derived from verified session only, never from request parameters
- Ownership predicate in WHERE clause prevents unauthorized access
- Returns 404 (not 403) for non-owned invoices to prevent enumeration
- UUID validation prevents ID injection and sequential ID enumeration
- RLS policies enforce database-level authorization
- Minimal field selection excludes sensitive data
- Structured error logging without sensitive information
